372	 * Settling and approving also record the due fixed (n/a when the grade had no rate); rejecting records its reason;
373	 * re-settling records the previous due and the new one; voiding a SETTLED claim records the frozen due it reverses; voiding with a reason records it last.
374	 */
375	public class AuditClaimAction {
376	    public void audit(@Val ClaimAction action, @Val ClaimNumber number, @Val Claim claim, @Val ClaimActionRequest request,
377	            @Val PreviousDue previous,
378	            PersonRepository people,
379	            @RequestParam("user") String user, Audit audit) {
